<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net buyers of Japan stocks in week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net buyers of Japan stocks in week.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of Japanese stocks on the Tokyo, Osaka and Nagoya stock exchanges in the week of July 14 to July 18, exchange data showed.</p>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers for a 13th consecutive week.</p>
<p>The figures, which are rounded, are as follows:</p>
<p>    Total foreign buying	   890.20 billion yen</p>
<p>    Total foreign selling	  597.34 billion yen</p>
<p>    Net buying			 292.86 billion yen</p>
<p>    Previous week net buying	74.40 billion yen</p>
